<GameData>
	<Language_en_US>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Stir of Government Hate</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_HELP">
			<Text>Contempt towards the leadership has become popular amongst the new city in the empire, blaming all problems, big and small, on the choices we've made. While this is hopefully a passing phase, a continued lack of domestic support will be viewed as a major weakness in the empire. What do you suppose we do?</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_CHOICE_1">
			<Text>We live in a free society. Let them say what they want.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_CHOICE_2">
			<Text>We should encourage teachings of the more positive aspects of our nation...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_CHOICE_3">
			<Text>Throw any scums that disrespect our empire in jail for disloyalty!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_CHOICE_1_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_RESEARCH_STORED]+6 [ICON_FLOWER] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_CHOICE_3_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]-6 [ICON_OCCUPIED] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>	
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_ANTIGOV_CHOICE_2_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_RESEARCH_STORED]25% for +3 [ICON_FLOWER] Morality[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]50% for [ICON_PEACE] Morality[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]25% for -3 [ICON_OCCUPIED] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
